1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,500
The first visible level can contain at most 23 agents; the last needs at least 21.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:09,000
Strong connectivity makes every proper visible support shrink at the next level.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:13,500
After two strict decreases, only the required minimum remains.

4
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:18,000
Three losses exceed the two-agent slack. The first visible level must be full.
